cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "340B Duplicate Discount Detection Engine"
abstract: >-
  Claim-level detection of 340B duplicate discounts (MFP/340B,
  Medicaid/340B, same-fill diversion) reconciled against EDI
  844/849/867 purchase data, on Databricks with PySpark and dbt.
  Uses de-identified synthetic data with planted ground truth.
